Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.33,0:00:02.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.95,0:00:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Boxxo! Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.89,0:00:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, good morning, Lammis!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.39,0:00:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Karios, Gorth, morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.99,0:00:12.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for keeping watch again today!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.99,0:00:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing beats a sweet tea\Nat the end of a night shift!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.87,0:00:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.83,0:00:23.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welp, I died and was reborn\Nas a venting machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.09,0:00:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pretty bizarre situation\Nto find oneself in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.71,0:00:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Despite the weirdness of it all, I've\Nstill found ways to enjoy my new life.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.19,0:00:37.03,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(1773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.87,0:00:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the outside, I'm just a big metal box,\Nbut inside, I've still got a human soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.75,0:00:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this new world of wonders,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.41,0:00:50.29,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(1773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.01,0:00:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I travel to and fro on the back\Nof my super strong partner,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.01,0:00:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.92,0:00:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name's Boxxo. Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.21,0:00:52.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means yes, by the way.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.08,0:02:11.00,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(734,473)\fscx100\fsp.4\pos(430,55)}Hunters and Motives
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.39,0:02:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, summer already! Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.73,0:02:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm sure does fly, huh? Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.93,0:02:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a sky here with changing weather,\Nand the seasons change too, like on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.13,0:02:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I forget we're in a\Ndungeon with multiple strata.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.68,0:02:27.77,sign_Verdana,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(358,562)\move(430,280,360,275)\c&HEFF7EF&\3c&HAAA98A&\shad0\frz73.58\fax-0.35\fs8}Excellent Hyper Ice Cream
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.71,0:02:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once it really heats up, I'll\Nstart selling ice cream! Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.81,0:02:29.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey there, Mishuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.35,0:02:31.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I stand before you with a humble request.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.79,0:02:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By your face, it seems serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.63,0:02:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is quite serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.99,0:02:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have given it careful consideration.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.73,0:02:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dear Boxxo, your steel body\Nhouses a kind and noble heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.43,0:02:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your defense is top tier and\Nyou can even raise the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.99,0:02:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are a magical item, but nonetheless,\NI am totally enamored with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.85,0:02:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he say enamored?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.01,0:02:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so, Boxo, I ask that as of today,\Nyou grant me leave to call you master.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.33,0:02:56.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean enamored in like\Na platonic way, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.85,0:02:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a no?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.35,0:03:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Michelle is an expert hunter, no question.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.71,0:03:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But his social skills suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.67,0:03:05.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, that confession took\Na whole lot of courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.33,0:03:08.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta be mature about this. Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.17,0:03:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that means you accept?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.97,0:03:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you, Master Boxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.33,0:03:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't regret it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.43,0:03:15.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, we're just hugging his friends, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.97,0:03:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right? Just friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.89,0:03:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody's got themselves\Nan apprentice now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.99,0:03:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congrats, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.07,0:03:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big milestone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.98,0:03:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now wait just a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.09,0:03:26.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got nothing to teach an apprentice!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.41,0:03:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.63,0:03:30.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then, Master\NBoxo, first things first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.29,0:03:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is time for a sponge bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.15,0:03:36.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Boxo's sponge baths are my\Nresponsibility, so you don't need to bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.23,0:03:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.31,0:03:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to step on your toes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.41,0:03:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.93,0:03:41.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.07,0:03:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to find you all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.91,0:03:45.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Director Bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.39,0:03:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, Lamas, Hulamine, Mishra, We're\Ngearing up to hold a very important meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.21,0:03:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the Dead's Lament Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.81,0:03:53.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd love for you all to accompany me.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.94,0:03:56.94,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fscx76\an2\pos(320,295)}The Dead's Lament Stratum
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.43,0:04:06.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These humans, along with\Nthe magical item Boxo,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.29,0:04:09.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are the survivors of a harrowing\Nencounter with the Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.27,0:04:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The famous magical merchant box, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.57,0:04:14.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one that sells unusual items\Nat fair prices without the hassle?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.71,0:04:18.17,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (left),0,0,0,,{\fad(1,435)\fscx100\fsp1.7\an2\pos(276,264)}Director Origin
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.71,0:04:18.17,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (right),0,0,0,,{\fad(1,435)\fscx80\fsp0\an2\pos(538,230)}Dog Mountain Director
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.93,0:04:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.84,0:04:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention his useful\Nabilities that have
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.91,0:04:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,saved us from certain\Ndeath on many occasions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.15,0:04:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wasn't kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.81,0:04:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This must be important if the directors\Nof each stratum's hunters association are
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.18,0:04:28.43,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fsp0\an2\fad(438,393)\pos(295,265}Director Scorching
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.03,0:04:31.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here. Let's cut right to the chase. The\NNetherlord who appeared a few days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.65,0:04:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is the Demon Lord's left-arm\Ngeneral. I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.61,0:04:39.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That spells big trouble the\Nnetherlord that mysterious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.53,0:04:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fore-armed skeleton who made\Na surprise appearance and an
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.61,0:04:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unwelcome one when we defeated\Nthe dead's lament stratum lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.47,0:04:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He stopped Hulamis and\NShuey's hearts using magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.55,0:04:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luckily, I transformed into an AED,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.97,0:04:55.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and my electroshocks\Nsuccessfully resuscitated them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.65,0:05:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle that nobody died, but we\Ncan't let a bad dude like him run free.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.41,0:05:04.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Kerioyl, the leader\Nof the Menagerie of Fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.99,0:05:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see his face, but he\Nseems more menacing than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.83,0:05:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Question.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.85,0:05:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but what is a left-armed general?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.55,0:05:15.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Far to the north, beyond\Nthe reaches of this dungeon,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.33,0:05:18.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There lies a land ruled by the Demon Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.15,0:05:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a Demon Lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.45,0:05:23.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I guess it would be kind of weird\Nnot to have one in a world like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.15,0:05:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you think of the Demon\NLord himself as the head,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.65,0:05:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then rank the others in descending order.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.65,0:05:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right arm, left arm, then the right\Nleg, and the left leg as last.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.39,0:05:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the left arm general would be the number\Nthree rank in the Demon Lord's forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.13,0:05:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The number three rank, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.05,0:05:40.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would a leader be\Nin a place like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.91,0:05:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Demon Lord's forces\Nare never good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.31,0:05:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems unlikely that\Nthey would invade us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.81,0:05:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They would have to make it past\Nempires and fortified cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.33,0:05:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.87,0:05:55.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He attacked association members inside the\Ndungeon and our collective watch to boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.43,0:05:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means we hit him with everything\Nwe've got and show no mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.21,0:06:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you don't get this\Nriled up very often.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.71,0:06:04.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Letting him get away with this\Nwould be bad for business.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.29,0:06:06.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we've got some skilled\Nhunters who will help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.01,0:06:09.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Origin Stratum will\Nprovide some as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.49,0:06:13.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With what that bag of bones put my people\Nthrough, he's in for some serious payback.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.31,0:06:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall fight alongside you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.51,0:06:17.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, too, wish to settle the score.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.61,0:06:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got my fist, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.47,0:06:23.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After what he did to Hulemy and Shui, I\Nwon't rest until I suck him real good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.91,0:06:26.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That right, Boxxo? Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.31,0:06:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Hulemy, you can help us\Nfigure out the plan of attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.55,0:06:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll help with planning, but\Nthat bony jerk tried to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.09,0:06:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to pay him back in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.31,0:06:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like your style.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.55,0:06:41.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate all the enthusiasm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.77,0:06:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Clearblow-Legged Stratum will put\Nnothing but our best on this mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.55,0:06:50.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us all work together to bring down\Nthe Netherlord once and for all! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.53,0:06:53.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's times like these\Nwhen I can't help but
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.83,0:06:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,miss having fists to\Nraise with my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.93,0:07:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't long before the Aces from each\NStratum showed up to enlist in our cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.59,0:07:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, Lammis, Hulemy, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.49,0:07:09.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two are in the Assault Squad?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.47,0:07:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.77,0:07:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.85,0:07:16.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Been wondering where my favorite\Nsentient snack dispenser went.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.03,0:07:19.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see, I'll take the\Nusual Miss soup and a water.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.01,0:07:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.92,0:07:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today's the day I get\Nlucky with those numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.61,0:07:25.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The gate guards are one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.37,0:07:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why is the elderly couple I see\Nevery morning part of the assault squad?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.19,0:07:31.32,sign_Arial,text (lower left),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H4B4C47&\bord0\shad0\fs8\fscx70\pos(104,254)}Unable to dispense prize
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.19,0:07:31.32,sign_Arial,text (lower left),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H4B4C47&\bord0\shad0\fs8\fscx100\fsp1\pos(190,257)}Out of change
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.19,0:07:31.32,sign_Arial,text (upper right; red),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H1400A4&\bord0\shad0\fsp4\pos(544,125)}Vending
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.19,0:07:31.32,sign_Arial,text (upper right; gray),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H4B4E4B&\bord0\shad0\pos(490,203)}Yen
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.59,0:07:32.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.81,0:07:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You too, llamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.03,0:07:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hi, director.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.89,0:07:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard you were there\Nwhen Shui needed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.33,0:07:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.29,0:07:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hoxie runs an orphanage\Nin the Origin Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.33,0:07:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure she\Ntaught Shui archery, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.99,0:07:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Hoxie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.99,0:07:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you be joining us\Non this mission, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.81,0:07:50.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has life been treating you well?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.87,0:07:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shimelai, Yumite.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.31,0:07:53.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am, and it has.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.07,0:07:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They all know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.89,0:07:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, maybe I've\Nunderestimated all three of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.69,0:08:03.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That day, ace hunters from each\Nstratum came rushing to our aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.79,0:08:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we held a kickoff party before\Nsetting out after the Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.13,0:08:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So many different types of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.69,0:08:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, and I bet every one of them\Npossesses some kind of powerful blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.45,0:08:16.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with all the\Nold fogies around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.05,0:08:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ain't no nursing home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.67,0:08:20.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You geezers sure you're up to snuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.43,0:08:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.45,0:08:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what happens to people\Nwith no manners around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.07,0:08:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.03,0:08:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.11,0:08:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because it sounds like you're\Ntrying to start something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.51,0:08:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know who we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.61,0:08:31.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh. Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.75,0:08:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.66,0:08:33.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone getting mouthy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.69,0:08:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lamas, give this guy a\Nlittle thump and knock him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.57,0:08:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.81,0:08:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me you're with these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.01,0:08:41.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you bet I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.51,0:08:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I guess if you\Nwant to get technical,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.13,0:08:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still trying to get\Nthem to join my group.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.37,0:08:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's sweet, Captain Kerrioll.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.09,0:08:49.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said Carry Oil?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.75,0:08:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not Captain Kerioyl\Nof the Menagerie of Fools?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.61,0:08:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what if I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.81,0:08:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.72,0:08:57.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing at all, Captain Carry Oil!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.05,0:08:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said that was...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.89,0:09:03.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard it, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.23,0:09:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the leader of the Menagerie of Fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.37,0:09:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Name's Kerioyl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.57,0:09:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as my members are out of commission,\NI am especially grateful for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.25,0:09:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's rare for the captain\Nto greet anyone so politely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.85,0:09:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.01,0:09:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shui and the Red and White\NTwins have yet to recover,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.45,0:09:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they're apparently\Nsitting this one out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.37,0:09:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that they wanted to\Nstay behind, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.71,0:09:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Mishuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.27,0:09:27.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may be young and inexperienced,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.09,0:09:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I so look forward to your\Nguidance and encouragement.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.25,0:09:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And my name is Hoxie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.75,0:09:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here from the Origin Strand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.21,0:09:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there, I'm Yumite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.01,0:09:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My blessings are a bit of healing light\Nalong with a whole lot of swordsmanship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.77,0:09:41.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name's Shimelai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.63,0:09:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know magic and have several blessings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.79,0:09:44.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ask and I'll tell ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.99,0:09:46.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once again, I am Karios.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.87,0:09:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm Gorth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.49,0:09:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Hulemy, a magic item engineer\Nand Lamas' childhood friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.75,0:09:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's me, Lammis!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.15,0:09:57.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this here is my magical\Npartner, Boxo. Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.11,0:10:02.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, a vanguard, rearguard,\Nand recovery team.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.73,0:10:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a fairly well-balanced party.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.09,0:10:08.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,although our older member's\Nstrength has yet to be demonstrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.35,0:10:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have faith in Captain Kerioyl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.49,0:10:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know he won't lead us astray.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.93,0:10:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.19,0:10:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our search begins tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.85,0:10:18.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get sweet revenge\Non that bonehead! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.73,0:10:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo! Boxo!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:24.95,0:10:27.04,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,text,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(1773,1)\an8\fs20\pos(487,139)}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.41,0:10:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.54,0:10:32.00,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fscx76\an2\pos(320,295)\fad(1,433)}The Dead's Lament Stratum
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.55,0:10:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The following day,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.81,0:10:32.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we split into several teams and each group
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.17,0:10:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,headed towards their\Nintended search target.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.09,0:10:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry to saddle you\Nall with this dangerous task.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.79,0:10:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never change, do you, Director Bear?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.29,0:10:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your leadership style is as\Nself-deprecating as ever That's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.27,0:10:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everyone signed on willingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.83,0:10:47.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to apologize for
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.29,0:10:52.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there's a sight\Nthat brings back memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.71,0:10:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up ahead, there's a group\Nof monsters lying in wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.35,0:10:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.26,0:11:00.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yumite, Hoxie, why don't the\Nthree of us go deal with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.23,0:11:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A group effort with my senior members?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.19,0:11:04.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thought has me all nostalgic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.23,0:11:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, light and shroud my arrowheads.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.57,0:11:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love when she shoots three at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.17,0:11:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, expertly done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.57,0:11:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still fighting as dirty as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.13,0:11:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's our Hoxie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.43,0:11:18.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.49,0:11:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like those monsters are still so far
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.79,0:11:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,away that they haven't\Neven noticed us yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.97,0:11:24.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to invite them to the party!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.27,0:11:41.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good show, you three.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.85,0:11:44.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems your skills are as sharp as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.15,0:11:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, we're not in top form anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.17,0:11:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon, though, guess I had better\Npolish up my magic skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.47,0:11:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My cuts aren't as sharp as they once were.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.69,0:11:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only Agent could spare warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.27,0:11:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This battle is certainly not\None that I'd brag about to Shui,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.55,0:12:01.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the next one sure will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.25,0:12:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So modest, too, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.37,0:12:05.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna have to work hard to keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.39,0:12:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.87,0:12:12.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dang, this hits the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.69,0:12:15.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shui would be so jealous if she knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.09,0:12:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to try every one of\Nhis foods on this campaign.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.69,0:12:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it meant eating his food for every\Nmeal, would follow Boxxo to hell and back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.11,0:12:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.23,0:12:30.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back for as many helpings as\Nyou want, if it'll keep morale high.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.55,0:12:35.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's a tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.19,0:12:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lower your center of gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.13,0:12:42.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll make things much easier and\Nit'll improve your power and accuracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.39,0:12:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My center of gravity?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.03,0:12:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.75,0:12:51.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That felt much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.25,0:12:52.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it looked better, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.49,0:12:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your work should be about getting used\Nto fighting without Boxo on your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.15,0:12:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.55,0:13:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blessing of Might gives Lamas\Nmore strength than she can handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.81,0:13:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has to work hard\Nlearning to control it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.57,0:13:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usually she has me on her back, which\Ngives her just the right handicap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.29,0:13:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she could manage her strength\Nwell enough without me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.87,0:13:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Lamas!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.87,0:13:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boxxo. You got a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.17,0:13:31.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.47,0:13:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one thing's been bothering\Nme it makes no sense but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.49,0:13:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think the nether lord\Nlet llamas go on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.81,0:13:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heal me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.01,0:13:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he had wiped us out in that moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.77,0:13:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we wouldn't have reported back or\Nmet with the other stratum directors
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.17,0:13:49.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means this elite assault\Nforce would never have been formed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.41,0:13:53.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, what if his goal\Nis to use himself as bait to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.97,0:13:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gather as many ace hunters here\Nto this stratum as possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.05,0:14:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're right about that\Nthen we really fell for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.09,0:14:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway that's as far as i've\Ngotten with that theory though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.43,0:14:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know the worst case\Nscenario but i don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.97,0:14:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for sure so it's best\Nnot to cause any alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.85,0:14:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the only one I can tell, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.13,0:14:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.05,0:14:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.96,0:14:19.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.11,0:14:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't mind if I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.21,0:14:23.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.37,0:14:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a milk tea about it and relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.71,0:14:26.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.23,0:14:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The flow of magic power seems odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.23,0:14:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's increasing and\Ngrowing rather unsettled.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.03,0:14:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling this\Ncould spell trouble for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.13,0:14:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turns out the old guy was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.11,0:14:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not long after that conversation,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.89,0:14:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We discovered that another hunter\Nteam had found the Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.99,0:15:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.63,0:15:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.54,0:15:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in position behind him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.49,0:15:20.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hoxie and Shimelai will\Nprovide covering fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.17,0:15:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bet we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.51,0:15:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Karios and Gorth, you\Ntwo will stand guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.23,0:15:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sign your orders, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.83,0:15:29.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lammis, we have tons of aces\Nout here. Don't go nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.79,0:15:31.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.23,0:15:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help us out, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.89,0:15:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.49,0:15:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone else will charge him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.31,0:15:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While our goal is ultimately to slay the\NNetherlord, do not do anything reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.01,0:15:42.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can buy time until\Nreinforcements arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.65,0:15:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.99,0:15:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's show them what the\Ndungeon's finest can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.73,0:16:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.49,0:16:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Form change!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.67,0:16:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Power lesser!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.47,0:16:12.42,sign_13627_129_Refreshing__Mr__,text (orange),0,0,0,,{\an7\fs20}Refreshing\N{\c&H3810B5&\fs10\fad(1,138)} Mr. Pressure
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.47,0:16:12.42,sign_13627_129_Refreshing__Mr__,text (red),0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\shad0\c&H1C1C18&\pos(30,63)\fad(1,138)}Coin-Op\N Power\N Washer
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.47,0:16:12.42,sign_13627_129_Refreshing__Mr__,text (small black; upper right),0,0,0,,{\pos(381,66)\fs16\frz15.38\c&H121414&\3c&HA4A7A7&\shad0\fad(1,138)}Osugi Cleaning Factory
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.39,0:16:14.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And with telekinesis,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.93,0:16:17.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the new blessing I acquired in that\Nlast battle I've been training every
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.03,0:16:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,night to build up my physical strength\Nand dexterity let's see what I
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.21,0:16:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can do with it now how do you monsters\Nfeel about this huh I'm not technically
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.31,0:16:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a vending machine anymore but what\Nelse is new that was amazing boxo
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.47,0:16:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're just spinning our\Nwheels until we defeat the Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.25,0:16:55.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.57,0:16:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems he's using some\Nsort of regeneration spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.55,0:17:04.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, get away from there at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.73,0:17:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Netherlord is gathering a vast\Namount of magic power to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.53,0:17:11.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suspect it's some kind\Nof massive explosion spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.61,0:17:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's split right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.75,0:17:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what about the other team of hunters?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.17,0:17:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.63,0:17:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suggest you all cover your ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.23,0:17:21.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't have hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.13,0:17:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.31,0:17:25.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or eardrums, for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.67,0:17:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Major spell incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.59,0:17:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fall back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.61,0:17:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now why would they do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.87,0:17:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And was it in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.03,0:17:40.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deploying barrier!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.95,0:17:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.85,0:18:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a single death, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.15,0:18:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Elite hunters are not to be trifled with.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.23,0:18:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All my monsters perish, but so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.07,0:18:09.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can always make all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.27,0:18:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way to beat him at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.75,0:18:15.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only one of us has the power\Nto turn the tide of battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.79,0:18:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.91,0:18:22.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, the blessing of my\Ngirl and her magic item.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.65,0:18:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be your worthy adversary\Nif you can reach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.39,0:18:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.30,0:18:29.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's now or never.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.47,0:18:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not the real me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.11,0:18:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm far above the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.27,0:18:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas flung me up here during the\Nmayhem of that big explosion spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.51,0:18:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's carrying a decoy,\Na magic item Hulemy made.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.47,0:18:43.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The housing-only me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.43,0:18:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The real me transformed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.33,0:18:49.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Manipulated balloons using telekinesis and\Nis directly above the Netherlord's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.57,0:18:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here goes...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.07,0:18:52.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Form change!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.11,0:18:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Japan's largest vending machine, which\Ncan be found in a certain fishing harbor.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:55.38,0:19:05.14,sign_Verdana,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H724572&\3c&HC4AD93&\bord4\shad0\fs30}Ice
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.99,0:19:02.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over 18 meters tall and\Nhas even been featured on TV!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.13,0:19:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.04,0:19:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Giant Ice Vending Machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.73,0:19:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Find all you want, hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.79,0:19:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We shall see if you have\Nwhat it takes to reach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.37,0:19:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.28,0:19:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.69,0:19:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A vending machine, punk! What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.05,0:19:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came prepared in case I\Ncouldn't crush you right away!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:33.79,0:19:36.05,sign_TimesNewRoman,text (black),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H1A152A&\3c&H625D6B&\shad0\bord4\fs25}Automated External Defibrillator
Dialogue: 1,0:19:36.09,0:19:37.30,sign_Arial,text (white on red),0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(162,60)\c&HA0A0A0&\3c&H1A1380&\fs21\fsp.3\fad(271,1)\shad0}Release the lock and open this door
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.09,0:19:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before I took on this huge body,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.30,0:19:38.38,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\fs10\an7\frz5.31\fax-0.15\pos(250,55)\t(1528,1529,\3c&HF5F4F2&\c&H000000&)\t(1778,1779,\3c&H000000&\c&HFFFFFF&)}Coin Conversion
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.30,0:19:38.38,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\fs10\an7\frz5.31\fax-0.15\pos(245,120)\t(1778,1779,\3c&HF5F4F2&\c&H000000&)\t(2029,2030,\3c&H000000&\c&HFFFFFF&)}Vending Compartment Shock Absorber
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.30,0:19:38.38,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\fs10\an7\frz5.31\fax-0.15\pos(245,183)\t(2029,2030,\3c&HF5F4F2&\c&H000000&)\t(2279,2280,\3c&H000000&\c&HFFFFFF&)}Transformation
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.30,0:19:38.38,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\fs10\an7\frz3.37\fax-0.15\pos(240,250)\t(2279,2280,\3c&HF5F4F2&\c&H000000&)}Telekinesis
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.30,0:19:38.38,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\fs10\an7\frz2.68\fax-0.15\pos(239,320)}Change Paint Color
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.09,0:19:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I switched back to the regular vending\Nmachine and got my secret weapon ready!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.51,0:19:42.51,sign_19428_213_Use_according_to,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(100,20)}Use according to voice\N and visual instructions
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.15,0:19:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I increased my physical strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.71,0:19:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my maximum electroshock\Nis now off the charts!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.45,0:19:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eat, Fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.09,0:19:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.53,0:20:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.53,0:20:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.17,0:20:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.49,0:20:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No damage anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.67,0:20:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.58,0:20:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.97,0:20:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heads up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.99,0:20:22.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.63,0:20:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This staff is precious, you see!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.85,0:20:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.53,0:20:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nevertheless, you managed\Nto defeat a part of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.55,0:20:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it was merely my left arm transformed?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.35,0:20:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though that is worthy of praise indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.51,0:20:39.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His left arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.95,0:20:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.19,0:20:46.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may have defeated my appendage, but\NI did still accomplish my original goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.99,0:20:48.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was his original goal?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.17,0:20:54.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was to gather all the capable\Nhunters here in one place. Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.49,0:20:56.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hume's hunch was right on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.93,0:21:01.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, whenever hunters or\Nmonsters perish within this dungeon,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.43,0:21:03.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the dungeon itself accumulates power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.53,0:21:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in direct proportion to that of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.77,0:21:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I can employ said power\Nto produce more new monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.63,0:21:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is the way this dungeon operates.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.69,0:21:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.03,0:21:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems kind of similar to\Nthe way I run on points.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.85,0:21:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From that knowledge, a brilliant\Nplan fomented in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.31,0:21:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would kill everything\Nin this dungeon and
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.41,0:21:27.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,use the power to produce\Na new pack of monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.25,0:21:32.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, perhaps the more astute among you\Nhave already figured out what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.79,0:21:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.05,0:21:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If all the aces are gathered in\Nthis place, then that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.61,0:21:40.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other strata's defenses\Nare stretched thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.41,0:21:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they were attacked...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.91,0:21:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be real bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.59,0:21:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, given the current situation, don't\Nyou think it'd be wise to hurry back?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.83,0:21:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may transfer to other strata,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.27,0:21:54.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'll see to it that you\Ncannot leave the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.39,0:21:56.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so round two begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.01,0:21:58.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Struggle against me with all your might.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.91,0:22:00.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will not thwart me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.65,0:22:03.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give your lives and\Nyour power to my cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.77,0:22:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.87,0:23:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.08,0:23:40.07,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (upper left),0,0,0,,{\pos(50,60)\fs14}Next Time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.08,0:23:40.07,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (lower right),0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(435,300)\fs18}Mutual Understanding
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.83,0:23:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.

